  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rvben/rumdl/tarball/v0.3.5",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/rvben/rumdl/zipball/v0.3.5",
  "body": "\n### Changed\n\n- The MSRV policy is now a rolling window: rumdl supports at least the three\n  most recent stable Rust releases, and raising the MSRV within that window may\n  happen in any release, announced in the changelog. Previously an MSRV raise\n  required a minor release. Prebuilt binaries, PyPI wheels and npm packages are\n  unaffected.\n- Raise the minimum supported Rust version to 1.98 and move the MDX\n  JavaScript parser to Oxc 0.159, so projects that embed rumdl alongside\n  current Oxc link one copy of the parser. All dependencies, including the\n  development and fuzz ones, are upgraded to their latest releases.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- MD076 preserves loose-list spacing when blank-separated blocks inside an item\n  or required structural separators keep the list loose, preventing repeated\n  formatting changes when used with Prettier (#989).\n\n- **MD013**: leave lines exempted from other rules out of reflow (#1007) ([f0d9004](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/f0d9004954276eec1905009d62c40df191519464))\n- **docs**: readable prose measure and literal CLI flags on the docs site ([853837f](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/853837f5b98cb2dc0b92504c5c3a9f64c7e913f5))\n- **build**: make the CLI allocators optional for library consumers (#1004) ([0f735c2](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/0f735c2b59e06c045750a1dc2ddbf5a0c279c80a))\n- **ci**: refer dependency updates to the current MSRV policy ([9b554e4](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/9b554e4770e6ea932ca97015e4934e32f423065b))\n- **ci**: make dependency refresh complete and reviewable ([a05042c](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/a05042cfa2901552a90b25321dc73200279bedd5))\n- harden frontmatter handling and reference checks ([3ac13d5](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/3ac13d5a393d558ada6ab142a11123fec4605bea))\n- **yaml**: preserve scalar compatibility when parsing YAML ([fb181e6](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/fb181e6cb830ca4bd13d46c8bc7fe1327d987e12))\n- **MD013**: make frontmatter configuration consistent ([73aa9d9](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/73aa9d9603e0370877fcd55e4a7f4586a6327d36))\n\n### Added\n\n- **MD029**: add the explicit `zero` list style ([b16df44](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/b16df442a7b00f765d1b30b928b2631e70a58e83))\n- **schema**: describe rule options from the config structs (#1000) ([2237c7a](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/commit/2237c7adf193dcc55cad76cf985d7fd3a50d574a))\n\n\n## Downloads\n\n| File | Platform | Checksum |\n|------|----------|----------|\n| [rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | Linux x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | Linux x86_64 (musl) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz) | Linux ARM64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz) | Linux ARM64 (musl) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | macOS x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz) | macOS ARM64 (Apple Silicon) | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz.sha256) |\n| [rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip) | Windows x86_64 | [checksum](https://github.com/rvben/rumdl/releases/download/v0.3.5/rumdl-v0.3.5-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip.sha256) |\n\n## Installation\n\n### Using uv (Recommended)\n```bash\nuv tool install rumdl\n```\n\n### Using pip\n```bash\npip install rumdl\n```\n\n### Using pipx\n```bash\npipx install rumdl\n```\n\n### Direct Download\nDownload the appropriate binary for your platform from the table above, extract it, and add it to your PATH.\n"
